\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land E=[X]^2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}complete\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGraphCompleteGraph}_S(G,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists E\\;(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land E=[X]^2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph code is complete exactly when its edge component contains every two-element subset of its vertex set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,X,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphCompleteGraph}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}complete\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGraphCompleteGraph}_S(G,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists E\\;(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land E=[X]^2)","display":true}],"bytes":808,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2236","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-graph-complete-graph.md|58-df-zfc-graph-complete-graph]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0dc79ccc1050ee64"]}